(S, "Where is Bin Qasim Port located?", ["Gwadar", "Karachi", "Ormara", "Pasni"], 1, "Port Qasim is a deep-sea port on the coast near Karachi in Sindh. It is the second busiest port of Pakistan.", "Port Qasim was named after Muhammad bin Qasim and began operating in 1980.", [4148]),
