(S, "Which Islamic country is a nuclear power?", ["Pakistan", "Saudi Arabia", "Iran", "Turkey"], 0, "Pakistan tested nuclear devices in May 1998 and is the only Muslim country with nuclear weapons.", "Pakistan became the seventh country in the world to declare itself a nuclear power.", [4486]),
